00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:06.229
Film Courage: What are your five tips for getting a
movie made? R.L. Scott, Filmmaker: First off be realistic don't

00:00:06.229 --> 00:00:13.550
ask for two million dollars if you've
never made a film. Chances are you're

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:21.859
not going to get that funded so yeah I
would say firstly be realistic about

00:00:21.859 --> 00:00:26.980
where you are about what you're doing

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:36.649
create a situation where an investor
can't say no meaning have have a track

00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:43.699
record of work I truthfully I truly feel
like if you've never made a project you

00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:48.019
should not be asking for funding I feel
like you should do it yourself in the

00:00:48.019 --> 00:00:52.870
beginning I think you need to produce
some things yourself because you need to

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:58.460
to show a person why they should invest
in you I think it's hard to get people

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:03.800
to just give you money it's like saying
to someone hey I want to do heart

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:08.720
surgery on you I've never done it before
but I just swear I'm gonna it's

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:13.700
gonna be the most amazing surgery you've
ever had it's like it's hard to convince

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:22.909
someone to take that kind of risk when
the you haven't shown that you're

00:01:22.909 --> 00:01:29.659
capable of following through and I see
that a lot with a lot of young

00:01:29.659 --> 00:01:33.079
filmmakers they're asking for money
right out the gate like yo 2 million

00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:40.579
dollars my first movie and I'm just like
bro you're not gonna get that no it's

00:01:40.579 --> 00:01:47.659
gonna give you that mic so I would say
bring bring bring a lot more value than

00:01:47.659 --> 00:01:56.570
you're asking for meaning if if you have
to show makers if one has say never done

00:01:56.570 --> 00:02:03.409
a project before but he has a script and
a good story and an idea and he's asking

00:02:03.409 --> 00:02:08.569
