asking for and so on you know in the

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:36.180
beginning you want to set like a more
modest more realistic budget like

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:45.660
something that you feel an investor
could part with but give them incentives

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:49.530
